#: docs/explanation/index.md:8
msgid "Architecture explanations"
msgstr "架构解释"

#: docs/explanation/index.md:10
msgid ""
"Understand static assembly, execution and retained ownership before changing "
"a provider. Current production MCU support is limited to the F4 package; "
"Native belongs to explicit host-test support. Historical chip-specific "
"implementation records remain tied to their original source revision."
msgstr ""
"修改 provider 前，应理解静态装配、执行与保留所有权。当前生产 MCU 支持限于 F4 包；Native "
"属于显式主机测试支持。历史芯片专属实现记录仍绑定其原始源码修订。"
